    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-Is this determination really your own will?</h2>The morning of the beginning. That day when raindrops fell on a morning glory with the dawn in the background.<br><br>The time I tied my ponytail in a knot because I really wanted to change my life.<br>I woke up early to cheer up that person who was crying.<br><br>In a world where people treat you as if you have to be special to deserve to live.<br>In order to face the despair of not being able to become anything, boys and girls persisted in not giving up.<br><br>When they looked back at the end of their perseverance, they saw a rainbow-colored shine pushing them back,<br>A rainbow-colored glow pushing at our backs, a flash of cool breeze drifting around the world.<br>That was the news of our youth.<br><br>Remember who you are, who someone took from you.<br>Don't give up on yourself, don't allow yourself to be compromised in the slightest.<br><br>It is always the longing after the rain that turns the dull sky into clear skies.<br>To hold on to this news, you have to live your life, struggling until the dawn.<br><br>Then this is a story about regaining your true self.<br><br>Project;YouthSignal - Our Adolescence, Deliverance to All Youth<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the game</h2>This work is a text adventure.<br>You can progress the story by clicking on the screen.<br><br>Genre : ADV for all ages, youth perversion<br>About choices : Yes (no route branching)<br>Voice \uff1aFull voice except for some parts<br>Play time \uff1aAbout 40 to 50 hours",
